## 8. Definitions of done (per change type)

| Change type | Done means |
|---|---|
| Bug fix | root cause stated (file:line) · smallest fix · regression test · rules read listed |
| Feature | flag-gated default-off if user-visible · both/all clients · docs + changelog · backlog for deferred parts |
| Release | version + build bumped · TestFlight build uploaded · §3 updated · changelog entry · App Store Connect metadata checked by a human |
| Backend migration the app depends on | applied to target env · recorded in changelog · §3 updated · app degrades gracefully against the OLD backend |
| Data correction | dry-run first · explicit apply · post-write verification query · per-incident approval if production |

